/span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">自身价值时总会想起</span></p><p begin="03:02.329" end="03:07.939" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L31"><span begin="03:02.329" end="03:02.702">我愛</span><span begin="03:02.702" end="03:03.313">上</span><span begin="03:03.313" end="03:04.231">給我</span><span begin="03:04.475" end="03:05.695">勇氣的</span><span begin="03:05.695" end="03:06.719">Rainie</span> <span begin="03:06.719" end="03:07.939">Love</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">只要活着便已足够美好</span></p><p begin="03:08.184" end="03:11.231" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L32"><span begin="03:08.184" end="03:08.595">窗外的</span><span begin="03:08.595" end="03:09.006">雨</span><span begin="03:09.006" end="03:09.417">滴</span> <span begin="03:09.644" end="03:10.173">一滴滴</span><span begin="03:10.173" end="03:10.702">累</span><span begin="03:10.702" end="03:11.231">積</span></p><p begin="03:11.294" end="03:16.509" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L33"><span begin="03:11.294" end="03:11.950">屋內的</span><span begin="03:11.950" end="03:12.606">濕氣</span><span begin="03:12.606" end="03:13.918">像儲存</span><span begin="03:13.918" end="03:14.751">愛你</span><span begin="03:14.751" end="03:15.635">的</span><span begin="03:15.635" end="03:16.509">記憶</span></p><p begin="03:16.595" end="03:20.252" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L34"><span begin="03:16.595" end="03:17.700">真希望</span><span begin="03:17.700" end="03:18.810">雨能下</span><span begin="03:18.810" end="03:20.252">不停</span></p><p begin="03:20.331" end="03:26.252" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L35"><span begin="03:20.331" end="03:20.672">雨</span><span begin="03:20.672" end="03:21.687">愛</span><span begin="03:21.687" end="03:23.021">的秘密</span><span begin="03:23.310" end="03:23.681">能</span><span begin="03:23.681" end="03:24.659">一</span><span begin="03:24.659" end="03:26.252">直延續</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">若试着睁开双眼凝望</span></p><p begin="03:26.335" end="03:34.787" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L36"><span begin="03:26.335" end